    <string name="privacy">Privacy</string>
    <string name="privacy_text">Zen keeps everything on your device: your tasks, study sessions and settings. There are no accounts, no ads and no analytics, and the app never sends your data to anyone.\n\nIf backup is turned on in your phone\'s settings, Android backs the app\'s data up to your own Google account, where only you can restore it.\n\nYou can export your data or delete it at any time from Settings.</string>
    <string name="licences">Open-source licences</string>
    <string name="licences_text">Zen is built with open-source software:\n\n• Android Jetpack (AndroidX), Apache License 2.0\n• Material Components for Android, Apache License 2.0\n• Material icons, Apache License 2.0\n• Kotlin and kotlinx libraries, Apache License 2.0\n\nThe licence text is at apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0.</string>
