    <string-array name="study_tips">
        <item>Start with just one session. Momentum does the rest.</item>
        <item>Pick your hardest task while your focus is fresh.</item>
        <item>Phone away, timer on: 25 minutes is all it takes.</item>
        <item>Small sessions add up. Your future self will thank you.</item>
        <item>Write down what you want to finish before you start.</item>
        <item>Take your breaks properly: stand up, stretch, drink water.</item>
        <item>Progress, not perfection. One session today?</item>
    </string-array>
